## [0.4.0] - 2026-02-14

### Added
- Microservices architecture: 7 services (UserService, VehicleService, GarageService, ServiceHistoryService, ChatbotService, DiagnosticsService, LoggingService)
- YARP API Gateway on port 5100 with route configuration for all services
- 4 shared libraries (SharedKernel, SharedInfrastructure, SharedMessaging, ServiceDefaults)
- Database-per-service pattern with init-databases.sql (7 databases)
- Pre-commit auto-cleanup: tmpclaude-*, logs/, nul, .vs/, bin/, obj/, *.bak/*.tmp/*.swp
- VS Code files.exclude for tmpclaude-* temp files

### Changed
- Migrated from monolith (GRRADO.sln) to microservices (GRRADO.Microservices.sln)
- Updated 25+ documentation files: .NET 9 -> .NET 10.0, Swagger -> Scalar, localhost:5000 -> localhost:5100
- Updated docker-compose.yml for microservices (per-service databases, gateway, service containers)
- Updated .gitignore with nul, logs/, broadened .vs/ pattern
- Updated run-api.bat to launch gateway instead of monolith API
- Service ports: UserService 5101, VehicleService 5102, GarageService 5103, ServiceHistoryService 5104, ChatbotService 5105, DiagnosticsService 5106, LoggingService 5107

### Removed
- 300+ old monolith files (API/, Application/, Domain/, Infrastructure/, Abstractions/, Utility/ projects)
- MIGRATION-STATUS.md (obsolete migration reference)
- app/server/Configuration/error-codes.json (orphaned monolith config)
- Build artifacts: 66 bin/obj directories, .vs/ cache (1.2MB)
- Temp/log files: 400+ tmpclaude-* files, api.log, app/server/logs/ (5 files)

### Version Bump
**Proposed:** minor (0.3.0 -> 0.4.0)
**Reason:** Major architectural change (monolith to microservices), backward incompatible but pre-release
